odot/pulls/124202","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124202","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124202.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124202.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-07T14:25:39Z"},"body":"- Follow-up to #118796\r\n- See also https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124058#discussion_r4154424523\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nIn Rémi's shader compression PR, he noted that the current `format_buffer` has a pre-existing bug that causes the final value to drop on its own line. After investigating further, it appears it also makes the wrapping too large, extending the buffer by at least one tab's width. This PR fixes both issues, and restores the initial indentation in the generator scripts.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nSome local testing indicates that this implementation *should* be slightly more performant than before, though it's within enough of a margin of error that I'll refrain from the \"performance\" label.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.